  "steps": [
    "Add the washed quinoa and water to the cooker with 1 tsp oil and salt. Give it 1-2 whistles and let it sit for 5-7 mins.",
    "Take a charred bell pepper and blend with coconut milk until smooth.",
    "Add garlic and mushrooms to some olive oil and toss until golden brown.",
    "Then add the tofu and toss for 2 mins and add the gravy.",
    "Add the spices and let it cook for 4-5 mins.",
    "Now toss the quinoa with some basil leaves/spinach, pepper and lemon for 2 mins and serve hot with the tofu curry."
  ],
